graph TB
    Start([User Uploads Photo/Video]) --> Input[User Input<br/>• Media file<br/>• Pet profile<br/>• Optional context]
    Input --> Orch[🎯 Orchestrator<br/>Coordinates pipeline]
    
    Orch --> Vision[👁️ Vision Agent<br/>GPT-4 Vision<br/><br/>Analyzes:<br/>• Body posture<br/>• Facial expression<br/>• Environment]
    
    Vision --> VisionOut[Vision Analysis<br/>• Posture description<br/>• Expression details<br/>• Context notes<br/>• Confidence: 0-100]
    
    VisionOut --> Context[🧬 Context Agent<br/>GPT-4<br/><br/>Enriches with:<br/>• Breed traits<br/>• Age factors<br/>• Behavior patterns]
    
    Context --> ContextOut[Context Enrichment<br/>• Breed-specific info<br/>• Age considerations<br/>• Historical patterns]
    
    ContextOut --> Synthesis[🧠 Synthesis Agent<br/>GPT-4<br/><br/>Combines data:<br/>• All previous outputs<br/>• User context<br/>• Expert knowledge]
    
    Synthesis --> SynthOut[Behavior Synthesis<br/>• Primary behavior<br/>• Confidence score<br/>• Detailed reasoning<br/>• Alternatives]
    
    SynthOut --> Recommend[💡 Recommendation Agent<br/>GPT-4<br/><br/>Generates:<br/>• Actionable steps<br/>• Safety warnings<br/>• Vet consultation flag]
    
    Recommend --> RecOut[Recommendations<br/>• 2-3 specific actions<br/>• Safety warnings<br/>• Vet needed: yes/no]
    
    RecOut --> DB[(💾 Database<br/>Stores complete analysis)]
    
    DB --> Display[📊 Results Display<br/>Beautiful UI with:<br/>• Behavior label<br/>• Confidence<br/>• Explanation<br/>• Recommendations<br/>• Feedback buttons]
    
    Display --> Feedback{User Feedback}
    Feedback -->|Helpful| Learn[🔄 Future: Memory Agent<br/>Learn from feedback]
    Feedback -->|Not Helpful| Learn
    
    Learn -.->|Improves future analyses| Orch
    
